I think David's last statement is the most important.  If you're
feeling somewhat beat up, get swallowed by a vortex that can't hurt
you and hit the . button until you are a) healed up or b) expelled. 
Of course, you could hit (s)earch, which gives a slightly YAFM.  While
you're swallowed by a harmeless vortex, dangerous air elementals can't
get at you!

But yes, take !oFH with you and use them wisely.  AC makes no
difference to an air elemental's ability to dish out trememdous
damage.  Displacement is a good thing, since it causes the first round
of attacks from a monster to miss.

Otherwise, spend as little time as possible on air (unless you're
going extinctionist) as it is the most difficult of the elemental
planes.

